    <span class="fa-inline">یزد؛ نقشِ ماندگار در دلِ کویر</span>
    <span class="en-inline">Yazd; Timeless Patterns in the Heart of the Desert</span>
  </p>
  <p class="latin">Iran, A Thousand Colors</p>

  <nav>
    <a href="#art"><span class="fa-inline">اثر هنری</span><span class="en-inline">Artwork</span></a>
